{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49347","headline":"女冠子 四 · 牛峤","name":"女冠子 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双飞双舞，春昼後园莺语。\n卷罗帏，锦字书封了，银河雁过迟。\n鸳鸯排宝帐，豆蔻绣连枝。\n不语匀珠泪，落花时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}